      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "Tyrone is the man with vitiligo on the phone",
      "description": "The text identifies the man in the image as 'Tyrone', mapping the textual entity 'Tyrone' onto the visual entity 'man'. This is an analogical mapping where the person depicted is explicitly named in the text, creating a direct identification between the visual subject and the textual character.",
